---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /dtu/
pageTitle: "DTU Chipday 2027 - 20 April 2027"
needsMap: true
brand:
  url: "/dtu/"
  html: "DTU <span>Chipday</span> 2027"
navItems:
  - { href: "#program", label: "Program" }
  - { href: "#about", label: "About" }
  - { href: "#venue", label: "Venue" }
  - { href: "/sdu/", label: "SDU Chips & Dip" }
  - { href: "/archive/", label: "Archive" }
---

{# Hero #}
<div class="hero">
    <img src="/assets/hero-wafer.jpg" alt="Chip dies on a wafer" class="hero-wafer">
    <div class="date-badge">SAVE THE DATE &middot; {{ dtu2027.event_date_display | upper }} &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">{{ dtu2027.time_display }}</span> &middot; DTU LYNGBY</div>
    <h1>DTU <span>Chipday</span> 2027</h1>
    <p>The fifth DTU Chipday: an afternoon conference and exhibition on the Danish chip design ecosystem, for students, researchers and industry. This year in the {{ dtu2027.venue }}.</p>
    <div class="cta-group">
        {% if dtu2027.registration_url %}
        <a href="{{ dtu2027.registration_url }}" class="cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Register</a>
        {% endif %}
        <a href="{{ dtu2027.ics_url }}" class="cta{% if dtu2027.registration_url %} cta-secondary{% endif %}">Add to calendar</a>
        {% if dtu2027.info_url %}
        <a href="{{ dtu2027.info_url }}" class="cta cta-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Event page at DTU</a>
        {% endif %}
        <a href="/archive/2026_dtu/" class="cta cta-secondary">See the 2026 edition</a>
    </div>
    <div class="countdown" id="countdown" data-target="{{ dtu2027.event_date }}">
        <div class="unit"><span class="num" data-u="d">--</span><span class="label">Days</span></div>
        <div class="unit"><span class="num" data-u="h">--</span><span class="label">Hours</span></div>
        <div class="unit"><span class="num" data-u="m">--</span><span class="label">Minutes</span></div>
    </div>
</div>

{# Program #}
<section id="program">
    <h2>Program</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">{{ dtu2027.title }} &mdash; {{ dtu2027.event_date_display }}, {{ dtu2027.time_display }}.</p>
    <div class="about-card">
        <h3>Program coming in early 2027</h3>
        <p>The organizing team starts planning in January 2027, and speakers and the program will be published here. Until then, the <a href="/archive/2026_dtu/">2026 program, photos and slides</a> show what to expect: talks on chip education, technical industry work and research outlooks, plus company booths.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<hr class="divider">

{# About #}
<section id="about">
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">What is DTU Chipday?</p>
    <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-card">
            <h3>The Event</h3>
            <p>DTU Chipday is a yearly half-day conference and exhibition, started in 2022 by DTU Compute and a group of industry players to highlight the Danish semiconductor industry. 2027 is the fifth edition. It moves to the larger {{ dtu2027.venue }} to make room for more company booths.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-card">
            <h3>Who Should Attend</h3>
            <p>Students, faculty and industry professionals interested in the Danish chip design ecosystem. Expect talks, company exhibitions, networking, and openings for thesis projects and jobs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-card">
            <h3>Exhibiting</h3>
            <p>Companies that want a booth at DTU Chipday 2027 are welcome to contact the organizing team below.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Contact Organizing Team</h3>
    <div class="companies-grid" style="max-width: 700px;">
        {% for org in organizers %}
        <div class="about-card">
            <h3>{{ org.name }}</h3>
            <p>{{ org.role }}<br>
            <a href="mailto:{{ org.email }}">{{ org.email }}</a>
            {% if org.phone %}<br><a href="tel:{{ org.phone | replace(' ', '') }}">{{ org.phone }}</a>{% endif %}
            </p>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>

<hr class="divider">

{# Venue #}
<section id="venue">
    <h2>Venue</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">{{ dtu2027.venue }}{% if dtu2027.venue_address %} &mdash; {{ dtu2027.venue_address }}{% endif %}</p>
    <div id="map"></div>
</section>
